  "release_notes_md": "## v0.7.2 \u2014 Maintenance release\n\nSmall reliability fixes on top of v0.7.1. No user-facing feature changes.\n\n- **Offline catalog cache fixed.** The last-good cache of the update and\n  support-pack catalogs now persists correctly. Previously the write failed\n  silently, so a restart while offline (air-gapped) would drop the cached\n  catalogs until the next online refresh.\n- **Support-pack metadata corrected.** Published packs now stamp an accurate\n  minimum-API-version.\n",
